  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-missing-ice-cube-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "258caad541887947ebb1118cd8d63d5d7ed6508d98a6307bd3955eba472bb7ac",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c499361cad61b97bdb699be3b2137203096607dbcd86756a2a1d3d1d70084fe0",
      "text": "冰块失踪案",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d3cc58bcd4eca051258b254a1fc627cef95aaf99825ab8f4dbc8cdecc272d114",
      "text": "悟空从冷冻室拿出一块冰。\n哇，好冰！又冷又硬。\n他把冰块放在小托盘里。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3258442bae694965283e10664298d33d054805b55bc3e42b76bd41e9fbafc46f",
      "text": "悟空说：“你就当我的冰块船吧，\n我和敖丙给你做一面小旗！”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d0ed04af2f89fd14b4856e12a53d67d8c0f2d1a29e00943ee6c53dcb3a7ec16a",
      "text": "悟空和敖丙一起画小旗，\n慢慢地、仔仔细细地涂颜色。\n这一画，就画了好久好久。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "44000243f987287fcf65596f0321cfb03370c3f556387dbafc353779e914c7c0",
      "text": "他举着小旗跑回来——\n冰块不见了！\n托盘里只有一小摊水和一点\n点小冰角。\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6f609e798c511d42333b1d52fa0b684e620f0b0a3e6d0dce70ce38b34520669e",
      "text": "悟空拿来放大镜：\n“是谁拿走了我的冰块？”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "28e23e91932bf03a4606f2fec77078882b978553d7ea4593f04277dca31d74e5",
      "text": "他找找桌子底下，\n找找水槽里面，\n连自己的鞋子里都找了！\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8320885e54a4781a5af62152484d60b573da884fa378938e8ce74505ab33b192",
      "text": "敖丙凑近托盘仔细看：\n“这儿还有最后一点冰，\n它越变越小了。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "47c745771ce8a4c08a7f7639c83c388e538de1aa49823baeacff518c614a8738",
      "text": "敖丙说：“厨房里暖和，\n冰一暖和，就化成了水。”\n冰块没有跑掉，它是变了样！\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e2cfed03766b768dbf2c2efed310efd2238b1e8df0ff367c05ac3e5bb10adb90",
      "text": "他们一起盯着那一点小冰角。\n滴答……滴答……它慢慢\n化完了。\n现在全都是水了。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "429ca8a345cc96dbac26e30aa4191f5c404d4ed2e3d9214e455611dd6aa0e373",
      "text": "敖丙说：“冰是固体，可以拿\n在手里；\n水是液体，会流动。”\n悟空把托盘轻轻一歪，水就滑到\n了一边！\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a19ba333c3a0c5d4510e2fcc0674344e223510ec33bc40a766e002b21139352a",
      "text": "悟空问：“它还能变回冰吗？”\n沙僧说：“冻一冻就行。”\n他们把水倒进小鱼冰模里。\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8cfac2fc1a38d0d46ac9fe299afa80cb553c039b8598ca8ec8f8ab85f2d5e3a1",
      "text": "沙僧把冰模放进冷冻室，\n里面冷冰冰的。\n“现在要等一等，等到明天。”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c800253368ac045225b2e970721bd5f2dd17975ae0eca14389b05c60bb68a7f3",
      "text": "那天晚上，悟空踮着脚走到\n冰箱前，\n小声说：“晚安，小水滴。”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ce98d996313b78ede272a6b4f6bb7f3d709cbcfbc8d2b674a07f8350e92e3288",
      "text": "第二天早上，他们打开冷冻室。\n水结成冰了！\n变成了一条小冰鱼。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bfa55ed7dbca05f9c8a5f023627f27173941844713495940663c446b67181a60",
      "text": "悟空说：“破案啦！”\n结案卡上画着：冰，水，又\n变回冰。\n沙僧把小冰鱼放回冷冻室，\n悟空收好放大镜，下次还要用。\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
